        "subheading_QigrNq": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "At Milano Jewelry, we believe exceptional jewelry should feel effortless to own. From secure checkout options to flexible monthly financing, we offer payment solutions designed around your lifestyle."
          }
        },
        "text_YL7WHr": {
          "type": "text",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Choose from trusted payment methods and financing partners with rates starting at 0% APR for qualified customers.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "text_x33WR9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At Milano, we understand that your jewelry acquisition might commemorate life's significant milestones or simply be a delightful indulgence. We provide a range of convenient payment options, including flexible financing plans with affordable monthly installments and rates starting from 0% APR. Rest assured, we have a payment solution tailored to suit your unique purchase.<br/><br/>For our customers within the US, we offer an array of seamless payment options at checkout to streamline your shopping experience and expedite your purchase. Select from our preferred payment methods listed below or explore our financing alternatives for added flexibility.</p><p><strong>Payment Methods</strong></p><ul><li>Credit Cards</li><li>Venmo (Must Contact Customer Service)</li><li>Apple Pay</li><li>Google Pay</li><li>Wire Transfers (Must Contact Customer Service)</li><li>PayPal</li></ul><p></p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "heading_brEXEf": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Financing Options",
            "use_h1": false
          }
        },
        "image_w7jW6a": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/affirm.webp",
            "image_width": 220,
            "url": ""
          }
        },
        "text_4nKVA3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Affirm Financing</strong><br/>Benefit from special financing with Affirm, allowing you to enjoy easy monthly payments for a period of up to 36 months, with attractive rates starting from 0% APR! Simply provide some basic details, and Affirm will promptly determine your credit limit and payment terms. Please note, Affirm financing is exclusively available to our US customers and may not be accessible in all states. To pre-qualify with Affirm, visit Affirm.com or contact them at 855-423-3729.</p><p><strong>Flexible Payment Plans</strong><br/>Opt for monthly payments spanning up to 36 months, with financing starting from 0% APR*. For instance, a $2,000 purchase could translate to monthly installments as low as $69.57 over 36 months at 15% APR. *Discover more on our Affirm Financing Page.</p><p><strong>Immediate Decision</strong><br/>Upon completing your loan application, we can promptly process your order, allowing you to select a payment schedule that aligns with your preferences.</p><p><strong>No Credit Impact</strong><br/>Rest assured, checking your eligibility with Affirm will not adversely affect your credit.</p><p><strong>Hassle-Free Checkout</strong><br/>Simply choose Affirm at checkout and provide some essential details to receive an instant loan decision.</p><p><em>Rates from 0–36% APR. Payment options through Affirm are subject to an eligibility check and are provided by these lending partners:</em><a href=\"http://affirm.com/lenders\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"http://affirm.com/lenders\"><em>affirm.com/lenders</em></a><em>. Options depend on your purchase amount, and a down payment may be required. CA residents: Loans by Affirm Loan Services, LLC are made or arranged pursuant to a California Financing Law license. For licenses and disclosures, see </em><a href=\"http://affirm.com/licenses\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"http://affirm.com/licenses\"><em>affirm.com/licenses</em></a><em>. For example, a $800 purchase could be split into 12 monthly payments of $72.21 at 15% APR.</em></p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        },
        "image_WUfCBC": {
          "type": "image",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Synchrony-Bank-e1517363885921.webp",
