        "text_RtD7bW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p><strong>Synchrony Financing</strong></p><p>At Milano, we are pleased to offer Synchrony Financing as part of our flexible payment options to enhance your shopping experience with us. Synchrony Financing provides you with convenient financing solutions tailored to suit your needs, allowing you to spread out your payments over time with competitive rates and terms.</p><p>To take advantage of our Synchrony Financing option, use the following <a href=\"https://www.synchrony.com/mmc/LX170338000\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.synchrony.com/mmc/LX170338000\">link</a> to apply for your Synchrony Financing Milano Credit Card. Once approved, simply return to our website and select <strong>Synchrony Financing at checkout</strong> to complete your order with flexible monthly payments.</p><p>Enjoy a smoother, faster financing experience now<strong> fully available online</strong> at Milano with Synchrony Financing, making your dream jewelry purchase a reality.</p>",
            "enlarge_text": false
          }
        }
